{"id":27830,"author":"LFT","body":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eHello,\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eThe Qualifiers will take place on Saturday July 22nd\u0026nbsp;and Saturday July 29th.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003eBelow are the start times for both Group A \u0026amp; B on those days:\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eGroup A:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eCheck-in:\u003c/b\u003e Saturday 22nd, 11:30am EDT/4:30pm BST\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eStart-Time:\u003c/b\u003e Saturday 22nd, 12pm EDT/5pm BST.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eGroup B:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eCheck-in:\u003c/b\u003e\u0026nbsp;Saturday 29th,\u0026nbsp;11:30am EDT/4:30pm BST\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eStart-Time:\u003c/b\u003e\u0026nbsp;Saturday 29th, 12pm EDT/5pm BST.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003ci\u003e(All matches together wi